@startuml
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName SimSun
skinparam defaultFontSize 17
skinparam dpi 200
skinparam ArrowColor black
skinparam NoteBackgroundColor white
skinparam NoteBorderColor black
skinparam ActorBackgroundColor white
skinparam BoundaryBackgroundColor white
skinparam ControlBackgroundColor white
hide footbox
skinparam maxMessageSize 150
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
skinparam sequence {
 ParticipantBackgroundColor white
 ParticipantBorderColor black
 LifeLineBorderColor black
 LifeLineBackgroundColor white
 ArrowColor black
 GroupBackgroundColor white
 GroupBorderColor black
}
actor "前台" as A0
boundary "<u>:前台接口</u>" as B0
control "<u>:查询预约及接诊</u>\n<u>安排控制</u>" as K
participant "<u>:患者</u>" as Patient
participant "<u>:预约</u>" as Appointment
participant "工作单元" as W
participant "数据映射器" as DM
participant "权限与会话服务" as AUTH
A0 -> B0 : 查询UC-02办理依据
activate B0
B0 -> B0 : 检查输入格式()
B0 -> K : 查询(ctx, UC02Query)
activate K
group 同一读取快照
K -> W : 开始读事务()
W --> K : 同一连接
K -> AUTH : 核对岗位及对象(ctx, 引用)
AUTH --> K : 有效授权依据或拒绝
K -> DM : 装载(对象引用、连接)
DM --> K : 实体与依据快照
K -> Patient : 核对身份(患者或日期查询范围)
activate Patient
Patient --> K : 处理结果或拒绝原因
deactivate Patient
K -> Appointment : 提供安排及经历(筛选条件、岗位范围)
activate Appointment
Appointment --> K : 处理结果或拒绝原因
deactivate Appointment
alt 本阶段全部校验通过
K -> W : 结束读事务()
else 任一步骤拒绝或保存失败
K -> W : 回滚()
end
end
K --> B0 : 本阶段结果及下一步依据
deactivate K
B0 --> A0 : 展示结果、状态和原因
deactivate B0
note over K,Appointment
校验不通过时返回规约中的原因；
本阶段不留下部分有效结果。
end note

@enduml
